1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 41]</font>

15
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, the Consort is here.</font>

16
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:22,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You may leave us.</font>

17
00:01:22,320 --> 00:01:22,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

18
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:34,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

19
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A woman without resolve
won't hold her place.</font>

20
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:44,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

21
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still need to find Jun.</font>

22
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If there's nothing else,</font>

23
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:49,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take my leave.</font>

24
00:01:50,160 --> 00:01:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying, you look truly lovely today.</font>

25
00:01:52,080 --> 00:01:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Such beauty,</font>

26
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:54,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you won't let me take a longer look.</font>

27
00:01:54,360 --> 00:01:55,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a pity.</font>

28
00:01:58,560 --> 00:01:59,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually,</font>

29
00:01:59,440 --> 00:02:00,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">staying a little longer is fine.</font>

30
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dear,</font>

31
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was wrong.</font>

32
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wrong about what?</font>

33
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was wrong to keep it from you.</font>

34
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:18,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No matter what happens,</font>

35
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:21,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I should face it with you.</font>

36
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit.</font>

37
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:28,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I prepared these dishes for you myself.</font>

38
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:30,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have a taste.</font>

39
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:34,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which one would you like?</font>

40
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me serve you.</font>

41
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:38,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try it.</font>

42
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

43
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying,</font>

44
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I specially asked the Great Emperor</font>

45
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the imperial consorts' favorite</font>

46
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jade Face Roller.</font>

47
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:01,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They say rolling it gently on the face</font>

48
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">improves circulation and tightens skin.</font>

49
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:04,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wonder if you</font>

50
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will like it.</font>

51
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:13,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since you've been so thoughtful,</font>

52
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:15,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how could I refuse your kindness?</font>

53
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I shall</font>

54
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:21,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">reluctantly give it a try.</font>

55
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:27,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This feels so nice.</font>

56
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:28,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's cool.</font>

57
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:30,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

58
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:31,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's really soothing.</font>

59
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:33,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The weather has turned cold lately.</font>

60
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You sleep alone.</font>

61
00:03:36,440 --> 00:03:37,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will it be warm enough?</font>

62
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:38,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, it will.</font>

63
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:40,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even when you're away,</font>

64
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they wouldn't dare mistreat me.</font>

65
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:42,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My duvet</font>

66
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:43,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is the thickest one in this residence.</font>

67
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's nothing.</font>

68
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just want to tell him</font>

69
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that I no longer mind the things</font>

70
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he did to me at all.</font>

71
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:00,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I almost killed you.</font>

72
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:04,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That wasn't you.</font>

73
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

74
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">thank you for coming back.</font>

75
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:15,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you for forgiving me.</font>

76
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying,</font>

77
00:04:21,280 --> 00:04:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you still upset with me</font>

78
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for keeping things from you?</font>

79
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only feared
you'd risk yourself for me.</font>

80
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:28,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I truly didn't mean to.</font>

81
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I swear...</font>

82
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't say such unlucky things.</font>

83
00:04:35,640 --> 00:04:37,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I still made you angry.</font>

84
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You truly thought I was angry?</font>

85
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was learning something</font>

86
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:44,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from Jun.</font>

87
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's called husband-taming.</font>

88
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:47,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Husband-taming?</font>

89
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She said</font>

90
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that once I pass this test,</font>

91
00:04:51,320 --> 00:04:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll secure a wife's position</font>

92
00:04:53,200 --> 00:04:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the household.</font>

93
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could Wei teach you</font>

94
00:04:59,080 --> 00:05:00,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the art of husband-taming?</font>

95
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:02,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your husband must do it himself.</font>

96
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:40,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai!</font>

97
00:05:41,200 --> 00:05:42,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, what's wrong?</font>

98
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, don't frighten me!</font>

99
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:45,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai!</font>

100
00:05:45,840 --> 00:05:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, what's happening?</font>

101
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, don't scare me like this.</font>

102
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:50,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai!</font>

103
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong with you?</font>

104
00:05:53,440 --> 00:05:53,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, eat up.</font>

105
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:55,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try my cooking.</font>

106
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way.</font>

107
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it really that bad?</font>

108
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not bad.</font>

109
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:20,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's quite good.</font>

110
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:23,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, don't eat that.</font>

111
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:24,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me get you something else.</font>

112
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:29,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun, something's wrong!</font>

113
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:30,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun!</font>

114
00:06:31,320 --> 00:06:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something's happened to Mobai!</font>

115
00:06:40,640 --> 00:06:41,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did you two do in the room?</font>

116
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:43,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We didn't do anything.</font>

117
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:45,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We just kissed, and he became like this.</font>

118
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Was he poisoned?</font>

119
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:51,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Precisely.</font>

120
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:53,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This poison is mild</font>

121
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:54,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and takes effect slowly,</font>

122
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:56,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">building up day by day</font>

123
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:59,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to reach His Highness's current state.</font>

124
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But once it fully breaks out,</font>

125
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:03,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">even I am powerless.</font>

126
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:04,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It built up day by day?</font>

127
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:10,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could he have been poisoned in the Sect?</font>

128
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was Yaoji.</font>

129
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:15,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is Yaoji?</font>

130
00:07:17,280 --> 00:07:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the Palace dungeon.</font>

131
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:19,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She'll be executed at the Zi hour.</font>

132
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a surprise.</font>

133
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:29,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Grandlord poisoning
the Fourth Prince</font>

134
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">actually saved my life.</font>

135
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:33,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you have the antidote?</font>

136
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, I do.</font>

137
00:07:35,440 --> 00:07:36,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you want the antidote,</font>

138
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:38,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">agree to my terms.</font>

139
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

140
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:43,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want</font>

141
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:45,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">enough money to keep me secure</font>

142
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the rest of my life,</font>

143
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I want to leave Xizhao.</font>

144
00:07:49,920 --> 00:07:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

145
00:07:57,960 --> 00:07:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before I leave Xizhao,</font>

146
00:08:00,440 --> 00:08:01,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want Qin Wei as my hostage.</font>

147
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:04,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A hostage?</font>

148
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:06,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'd be better off dead.</font>

149
00:08:07,960 --> 00:08:08,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

150
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:11,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will never agree to this.</font>

151
00:08:17,320 --> 00:08:17,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I accept your terms.</font>

152
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However, to prove your sincerity,</font>

153
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:23,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must first hand over
half the antidote.</font>

154
00:08:24,080 --> 00:08:24,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Deal.</font>

155
00:08:29,760 --> 00:08:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

156
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:32,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know you're desperate
to save your brother,</font>

157
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but this is far too reckless.</font>

158
00:08:36,160 --> 00:08:36,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if Yaoji...</font>

159
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll protect me, won't you?</font>

160
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fortune and misfortune go hand in hand.</font>

161
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:50,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll stand together in life and death.</font>

162
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The poison in His Highness's body</font>

163
00:09:04,680 --> 00:09:06,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has been temporarily suppressed.</font>

164
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:08,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once he takes
the other half of the antidote,</font>

165
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:10,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he will be completely cured.</font>

166
00:09:11,040 --> 00:09:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Imperial Physician, thank you.</font>

167
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:16,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

168
00:09:18,640 --> 00:09:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Mobai</font>

169
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:21,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is still in a daze.</font>

170
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:24,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Sect has been utterly destroyed.</font>

171
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if we let her go,</font>

172
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she can't stir up any trouble.</font>

173
00:09:29,640 --> 00:09:30,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's fine, then.</font>

174
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:33,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just feel sorry for Mobai.</font>

175
00:09:50,920 --> 00:09:53,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The carriage and money are ready.</font>

176
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

177
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:56,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's Li Congyao?</font>

178
00:09:58,160 --> 00:10:00,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why care about my husband?</font>

179
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:02,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shall we go now?</font>

180
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:04,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll trouble you</font>

181
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:06,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to keep me company along the way.</font>

182
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:10,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you going?</font>

183
00:10:11,400 --> 00:10:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Out of the city first.</font>

184
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying,</font>

185
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:37,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has he gotten any better?</font>

186
00:10:45,680 --> 00:10:47,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haven't Li Congyao and Qinglan come by?</font>

187
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:51,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, no.</font>

188
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:53,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't seen them since I woke up.</font>

189
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:55,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They wouldn't just abandon me</font>

190
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and head back to Beiyuan, would they?</font>

191
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They must have gone
for some alone time.</font>

192
00:10:58,960 --> 00:11:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the third wheel.</font>

193
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:01,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give them some space.</font>

194
00:11:02,440 --> 00:11:03,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How am I a third wheel?</font>

195
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't disturb Mobai's rest.</font>

196
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:08,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We need our alone time too.</font>

197
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:11,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan, you go out first.</font>

198
00:11:32,800 --> 00:11:33,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone's paired up.</font>

199
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:04,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss, we've reached the border.</font>

200
00:12:21,560 --> 00:12:23,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the remaining half
of the antidote.</font>

201
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:27,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it back and save him.</font>

202
00:12:28,760 --> 00:12:31,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait two more days,
and you'll be burying him.</font>

203
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:38,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You take this back first.</font>

204
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:39,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This...</font>

205
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

206
00:12:45,680 --> 00:12:46,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

207
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:48,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Worried my medicine is fake?</font>

208
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:51,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or have you grown fond of me</font>

209
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">over time?</font>

210
00:12:53,040 --> 00:12:54,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before my brother wakes up,</font>

211
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how could I let you leave?</font>

212
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:58,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That strike didn't kill you.</font>

213
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a shame.</font>

214
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:02,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you had died then,</font>

215
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling would still be mine.</font>

216
00:13:05,640 --> 00:13:06,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Without him,</font>

217
00:13:07,280 --> 00:13:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how could you have toppled our Sect?</font>

218
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:11,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In this world,</font>

219
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:13,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there are never so many ifs.</font>

220
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:14,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You dared to come today.</font>

221
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you afraid I'll draw my knife?</font>

222
00:13:19,680 --> 00:13:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A selfish, cold-hearted person like you</font>

223
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:23,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would never risk your life</font>

224
00:13:24,160 --> 00:13:25,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just to kill me.</font>

225
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:28,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Trading my life for yours</font>

226
00:13:28,400 --> 00:13:29,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is of course not worth it.</font>

227
00:13:29,960 --> 00:13:31,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think your husband</font>

228
00:13:31,160 --> 00:13:32,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is still following behind the carriage?</font>

229
00:13:34,640 --> 00:13:35,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One shouldn't always be</font>

230
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:37,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so presumptuous,</font>

231
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just as when I thought</font>

232
00:13:39,400 --> 00:13:41,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Heart-Devouring Poison</font>

233
00:13:41,640 --> 00:13:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would bind Ruling's heart to me.</font>

234
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But in this world,</font>

235
00:13:45,480 --> 00:13:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">nothing is ever absolute.</font>

236
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:50,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

237
00:13:51,680 --> 00:13:53,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard that this time,
you and Prince Duan</font>

238
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:55,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">reunited in Yanjing</font>

239
00:13:55,640 --> 00:13:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because of the Xizhao princess's murder.</font>

240
00:13:58,960 --> 00:14:00,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are now at the Xizhao border.</font>

241
00:14:00,960 --> 00:14:02,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The commander here
is an old acquaintance</font>

242
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:04,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of both you and Li Congyao.</font>

243
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:06,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's Hu Li, the very envoy</font>

244
00:14:06,800 --> 00:14:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who accompanied the princess</font>

245
00:14:08,400 --> 00:14:09,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to Beiyuan for the marriage alliance</font>

246
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:11,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and was demoted</font>

247
00:14:11,280 --> 00:14:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for incompetence.</font>

248
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He leads the patrol squad</font>

249
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">around here at this hour every day.</font>

250
00:14:17,800 --> 00:14:18,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If they run into each other,</font>

251
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:20,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what do you think</font>

252
00:14:21,200 --> 00:14:22,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will happen?</font>

253
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:25,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

254
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we finally meet.</font>

255
00:14:27,680 --> 00:14:28,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Surrender now.</font>

256
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:29,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hu Li.</font>

257
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:31,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've resigned and retired.</font>

258
00:14:32,440 --> 00:14:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have matters to attend to.</font>

259
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:35,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you know what's good for you,</font>

260
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get out of my way at once.</font>

261
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You murdered our princess</font>

262
00:14:40,960 --> 00:14:42,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and caused my demotion.</font>

263
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:44,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In Beiyuan, I couldn't touch you.</font>

264
00:14:44,680 --> 00:14:45,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But now, on my turf,</font>

265
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:47,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll make sure you never leave.</font>

266
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:50,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since words have failed,</font>

267
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll have to beat sense into you.</font>

268
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:55,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Attack!</font>

269
00:14:56,960 --> 00:14:58,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You set this trap deliberately</font>

270
00:14:58,880 --> 00:14:59,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just to exploit the old grudge</font>

271
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">between Hu Li and Li Congyao</font>

272
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:02,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to kill Li Congyao.</font>

273
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd like to see</font>

274
00:15:12,560 --> 00:15:13,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who can protect you now.</font>

275
00:15:33,760 --> 00:15:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's nowhere left to run.</font>

276
00:15:37,160 --> 00:15:37,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Wei!</font>

277
00:15:38,840 --> 00:15:40,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's time you pay back</font>

278
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:42,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">everything you owe me.</font>

279
00:15:44,760 --> 00:15:45,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei!</font>

280
00:15:57,960 --> 00:15:58,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei!</font>

281
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei!</font>

282
00:16:04,480 --> 00:16:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei!</font>

283
00:16:26,160 --> 00:16:29,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince's Residence]</font>

284
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's awake.</font>

285
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:45,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

286
00:16:46,160 --> 00:16:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're finally awake.</font>

287
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:48,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

288
00:16:50,800 --> 00:16:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me help you up.</font>

289
00:16:53,720 --> 00:16:54,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened?</font>

290
00:16:55,680 --> 00:16:56,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's Wei?</font>

291
00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:57,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank goodness you're awake.</font>

292
00:16:57,480 --> 00:16:58,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your coachman told us</font>

293
00:16:58,680 --> 00:17:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that to save you, Li Congyao</font>

294
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:02,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Qinglan secretly sent Yaoji away.</font>

295
00:17:02,840 --> 00:17:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

296
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They...</font>

297
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it slow.</font>

298
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:05,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Mobai!</font>

299
00:17:06,240 --> 00:17:06,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Mobai!</font>

300
00:17:08,320 --> 00:17:09,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei fell off a cliff!</font>

301
00:17:10,040 --> 00:17:10,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

302
00:17:10,600 --> 00:17:12,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take your guards to find her!</font>

303
00:17:14,530 --> 00:17:16,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

304
00:17:17,400 --> 00:17:18,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

305
00:17:19,070 --> 00:17:22,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

306
00:17:22,990 --> 00:17:27,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

307
00:17:27,670 --> 00:17:30,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

308
00:17:31,650 --> 00:17:35,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

309
00:17:36,180 --> 00:17:40,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

310
00:17:40,510 --> 00:17:46,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

311
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:52,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

312
00:17:53,320 --> 00:17:56,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

313
00:17:57,360 --> 00:18:01,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

314
00:18:01,910 --> 00:18:04,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

315
00:18:05,890 --> 00:18:10,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

316
00:18:10,490 --> 00:18:14,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
